  "content": "\n\n![Top Bar](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6fcfeba3062c7f63bc89e40a763023757f45ea1c.png)\n\n\n\\\n本简易资源包将深板岩瓦及相关方块（楼梯、墙、台阶和破损瓦）替换为深板岩瓦片。 \n\n\n\\\n\\\n![tiles to shingles](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b14400d5e2bbe00761ad313ac2247840aff308c3.png)\n\\\n\\\n原版深板岩瓦与新变体深板岩瓦片纹理的对比\n<br/><br/>\n<br/><br/>\n<br/><br/>\n\n\n\n**支持的语言：**\n- 英语 (en_us)\n- 波兰语 (pl_pl)\n\n<br/><br/>\n<p align=\"center\">\n<font size=\"5\"> <b>在其他平台关注我们！</b></font>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/hisho/\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a279e0c91678e4c5dcf40e2b493c18be18f0ff83_0.webp\" width=\"197\">\n&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Lobster_Project\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b0aeaaa86664636b3aef17480e3f43e7bcff8b0b.png\" width=\"197\"> \n&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lobsterprojectmc/\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b6b44379adf5bb705ab4e8b01db4efc084bd92f3.png\" width=\"197\">\n&emsp;<a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/lobsterproject.bsky.social\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/962d0a69aaf1855c89a0961d96f0d0ca6146a517.png\" width=\"197\">\n</p>",
